            <div class="error_info__msg">
               <p class="error_info__msg_heading">Sorry, this page isn't available</p>
               <p class="error_info__msg_description">This page is temporarily unavailable and we’re working to fix it as quickly as possible. Check back later or try one of the links below. Please note that while this page is down, response times may be longer than usual. Thanks for your patience.</p>
               <div class="error_info__altr_links" id="scriptResult">
                  <div class="error_info__links_one">
                     <p class="error_info__links_heading">Log into your account</p>
                     <p><a class="error_info__quick_link" href="https://logon.vanguard.com/logon">Personal investors login</a></p>
